1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:02,068
(Sheldon:)Well, I think you mean
my friends.

2
00:00:02,139 --> 00:00:03,809
(Sheldon:)And why wasn't
I invited to this?

3
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:05,945
(Amy:)Maybe because the two of us
being there

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:08,210
(Amy:)would make them feel awkward.

5
00:00:08,279 --> 00:00:10,109
(Sheldon:)We make everyone
feel awkward.

6
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,450
That's our thing!

7
00:00:13,584 --> 00:00:14,954
(Leonard:)They're running
a little behind.

8
00:00:15,019 --> 00:00:16,549
(Leonard:)Should be pretty soon.
Okay.

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,220
(Leonard:)Hey, if you're hungry,
there's a breakfast buffet

10
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,420
(Leonard:)at the strip club next door.

11
00:00:21,491 --> 00:00:25,731
(Penny:)Thanks, but I don't like glitter
on my scrambled eggs.

12
00:00:25,796 --> 00:00:29,796
(Leonard:)I don't think the strippers
prepare the meal, but okay.

13
00:00:31,201 --> 00:00:34,441
Look, it-it's not
how I pictured it either,

14
00:00:34,504 --> 00:00:36,074
(Leonard:)but I'm still glad
we're doing it.

15
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,970
(Penny:)Me, too.
You sure?

16
00:00:38,042 --> 00:00:39,442
(Sheldon:)Yes.
And you promise

17
00:00:39,509 --> 00:00:41,449
(Leonard:)you're okay with
everything from the car?

18
00:00:41,511 --> 00:00:43,211
(Penny:)Oh, my God, would you stop
bringing it up?

19
00:00:43,279 --> 00:00:45,109
(Leonard:)You're right.
I'm sorry.

20
00:00:45,181 --> 00:00:46,611
(Leonard:)We have the rest of our lives

21
00:00:46,683 --> 00:00:49,923
(Leonard:)to dredge stuff up from the past
and fight about it.

22
00:00:51,187 --> 00:00:52,287
(Leonard:)So what do you think?

23
00:00:52,355 --> 00:00:54,185
(Leonard:)Should we run next door
and grab a bite?

24
00:00:54,257 --> 00:00:55,727
(Penny:)What if they call our names?

25
00:00:55,792 --> 00:00:59,292
(Leonard:)Oh, don't worry. They gave me
this vibrating coaster.

26
00:00:59,362 --> 00:01:05,022
(Penny:)Oh, and the fairy tale
continues.

